Goals for this project: Deploy a working and reliable website that tracks
habits, goals, and adds an interesting niche to it that makes progress tangible. 
Some examples include the tree, from the website on ___ app and a pet that grows. Maybe create a small game where the characters have stats and the stats grow with your real life accomplishments?

create user levels and certain permissions to the levels of users. 

Goals to learn from this project: 

Front-end: Learn typescript and React

Back-end: Node.js with Express 

Database: PostgreSQL

DevOps and Tooling: Git and GitHub, Docker, learn pipeline best practices, and testing practices

Hosting and Deployment: Google Cloud Platform